{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"C4-03","example":{"issue":{"title":"單行道轉向，軌跡與行向提示是否一致？","intro":"多車道單向通行時，轉向軌跡與號誌顯示需要配合。","images":[{"key":"results:c4-03-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"crop":[763.649,167.69,2966.064,2613.715]},{"key":"results:c4-03-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:c4-03-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"trajectory","title":"轉向軌跡可能碰觸分隔島","text":"多車道轉向需檢視車輛軌跡，避免與鄰向設施衝突。"},{"id":"direction","title":"行車方向導引不足","text":"禁止進入、轉向限制與遵行方向的提示不夠明確。"},{"id":"signals","title":"燈號意義需清楚對應","text":"圓形與箭頭綠燈的選用，應與實際允許行向相互對照。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[137,138],"strategy":{"title":"清楚表達單行方向，檢核轉彎路徑","intro":"把單行與禁入提示、轉向軌跡及號誌設計一起檢視。","images":[{"key":"results:c4-03-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"trajectory","title":"確認多車道左轉軌跡","text":"檢核各車道轉彎路徑，避免左轉車輛與左側交通島碰撞。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"direction","title":"防止誤入單行道","text":"搭配指向線、單行道遵行標誌及禁止進入標誌，清楚表達可通行方向。","moduleId":"M2-04"},{"id":"signals","title":"以號誌與禁轉標誌配合","text":"人車仍有衝突時，運用圓形綠燈搭配禁止轉向標誌，減少箭頭綠燈的衝突情形。","moduleId":"M2-03"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/05-complex-scenarios/05-4-04-one-way-street.typ","sha256":"dde4d7804ca6769f230af59a93b0a0d38cf82cd3d9cbc314b818bc4449174ff5","scenario":"C4-03","title":"單行道","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:c4-03-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/05-複雜道路情境/current-conditions/C4-03/C4-03_現況圖_01.png","width":4137,"height":2987,"label":"C4-03 現況圖","scenario":"C4-03","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":137,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image157.png","sha256":"99dce3d454f2ffc36c9804a918f0b2b01461d9ffa2d7a037a7a42c510dcb8e2c"},"results:c4-03-photo-1":{"file":"materials/05-複雜道路情境/current-conditions/C4-03/C4-03_現況照片_01.png","width":1856,"height":1116,"label":"C4-03 現況照片","scenario":"C4-03","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sha256":"0649de6e4abdb3c7c5fd88409fc64f3ec1aa2131e6288554c0ddd34c735f1b8d","source":{"file":"C4-03_user-photos.json","sh